@startuml Role Definition
!pragma teoz true

' Title
title 使用者上傳圖片

' ------- 全域樣式 -------
skinparam backgroundColor #fefefe
skinparam roundcorner 15
skinparam DefaultFontSize 14
skinparam DefaultFontName Arial

' ------- Actor -------
actor FE    as "FrontEnd [Actor]"

' ------- Module -------
' ─ Conversation Management ─
box "Conversation Mgt Module [Module]" #LightGreen
	participant Conv_IM as "ImageManager [Actor]"
end box

' ─ Metadata Management ─
box "Metadata Mgt Module [Module]" #LightGreen
	participant Meta_IM as "ImageManager [Actor]"
end box


' STEP 0: FE 上傳圖片
group step 0: FE 上傳圖片
autonumber 0.0
note over FE: multipart/form-data\n(conversation_uid + image 檔案 PNG，上限 10MB)
FE -> Conv_IM: /upload_image
activate Conv_IM
Conv_IM -> Conv_IM: 驗證 conversation_uid 存在\n檢查檔案大小 ≤ 10MB\n檢查格式 = PNG
end group


' STEP 1: 建立 image metadata
group step 1: 建立 image metadata
autonumber 1.0
Conv_IM -> Meta_IM: /create_image_metadata\n{conversation_uid}
activate Meta_IM
Meta_IM -> Meta_IM: 建立 image metadata\n產生 image_uid
Meta_IM --> Conv_IM: 建立成功 {image_uid}
deactivate Meta_IM
end group


' STEP 2: 儲存圖片檔案
group step 2: 儲存圖片檔案
autonumber 2.0
Conv_IM -> Conv_IM: 儲存至 media/images/{conversation_uid}/{image_uid}.png
end group


autonumber 3
Conv_IM --> FE: 上傳成功 {image_uid}
deactivate Conv_IM

@enduml
